# ===== Nang: khong bao gio day len GitHub =====
# repo tham khao da clone (1 GB) — ai can thi tu clone lai tu nguon
repos/

# ban render (169 MB) — san pham dau ra, khong phai ma nguon
**/renders/
EXPORT/

# anh chup trung gian va snapshot kiem tra
**/snapshots*/
**/capture/
**/capture-*/
thumbnails/out/
**/public/shots/_*

# ===== File tam =====
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
D:/Temp/

# ===== Giu lai co chu dich =====
# assets/fonts/*.woff2      <- GIU: font da subset, nho, can de render lai dung
# public/audio/*.mp3        <- GIU: giong doc goc + nhac nen
# assets/sfx/*.mp3          <- GIU: hieu ung am thanh
# thumbnails/final/*.png    <- GIU: thumbnail da duyet

# ===== Ung dung desktop cai san trong thu muc du an =====
# VoiceStudio la phan mem cai dat (app.asar 470 MB, .exe 240 MB) — khong phai ma nguon du an
VoiceStudio/

# nhac nen cua du an khac, dung lai tu nguon goc khi can
# GIU lai README de ban clone sach biet thieu file gi va lay lai o dau
videos/*/assets/bgm/*
!videos/*/assets/bgm/README.md

# ===== Day chuyen tu dong =====
# cau hinh rieng, chua khoa va duong dan ca nhan
automation/config.json
# ket qua tung lan chay
automation/runs/
# ly do hong cua lan chay gan nhat — CI doc de nhan vao tin bao hong
automation/last-error.txt
# file giong doc ban bo vao
automation/inbox/
